:: Horse Academy Ash Morning
<<npc Ash>><<person1>>
<<if $horseacademycountdown is 0>>
	"Oh you're finally awake, thought ya were gonna be sleepin' forever at this rate." Ash sighs and places <<his>> hand on <<his>> hip. "It's racin' day, you ready?" <<He>> doesn't wait for an answer as <<he>> grabs your arm and pulls you along.
	<br>
	<<runicon>><<link [[Follow Ash to the track (2:00)|Regional Race Go]]>><<pass 120>><<if $regionalrace is undefined>><<set $regionalrace to 6>><</if>><</link>>
<<else>>
	"Oh, you're finally awake. Thought ya were gonna sleep the whole day away."
	<br> <br>
	Ash lets out a sigh and rests a hand on <<his>> hip.
	<br><br>
	"We got a race comin' up, darlin'. Can't afford to be slackin' off now."
	<br>
	<<if $rng gt 75>>
		<<He>> jerks <<his>> head toward the training grounds.
		<br><br>
		"Now c'mon. Let's start workin' on that athleticism of yours."
		<br><br>
		A teasing grin tugs at the corner of <<his>> mouth.
		<br> <br>
		"Lets build up ya speed so you can keep up while racin'"
		<br><br>
		<<runicon>><<link [[Follow Ash (10:00)|Horse Academy Train Athletics]]>><<set C.npc.Ash.love += 2>><<set C.npc.Ash.dom += 1>><</link>><<glove>><<gdom>><<gggathletics>><<gggtiredness>>
		<br>
		<<runicon>><<link [[Disobey Ash|Horse Academy Disobey]]>><<set $dailytrain to 1>><<rng>><<set C.npc.Ash.love -= 2>><<set C.npc.Ash.dom -= 1>><</link>><<llove>><<ldom>>
	<<elseif $rng gt 50>>
		<<He>> jerks <<his>> head toward the multipurpose room.
		<br><br>
		"Now c'mon. Let's start workin' on that physique of yours."
		<br><br>
		A teasing grin tugs at the corner of <<his>> mouth.
		<br><br>
		"Keep ya strong enough to pass up them other racin' horses."
		<br><br>
