:: Horse Academy Disobey
<<npc Ash>><<person1>>
<<if C.npc.Ash.love gte $rng>>
	"You thinkin' ya can just disobey my orders? I am ya trainer and you better start listenin' or ya gonna have a bad time." Ash begins to roughly grab at you and attempts to pull you along.
