	Ash takes a moment, breathing heavily as <<he>> gathers <<himself>> climbs away from you.
<<elseif $enemyhealth lte 0>>
    <<npcincr Ash love -5>><<npcincr Ash dom -5>>
    "You bitch!" Ash yells wiping the blood from <<his>> nose, "Just get the hell out of here."<<lllove>><<lldom>>
<<elseif $finish is 1>>
	<<npcincr Ash love -3>>
	"Can't even finish?" <<He>> says looking confused. "You young folks got somethin' wrong with ya."<<lllove>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
Ash leads you out of the back rooms and back into the main room of the academy.
<br><br>
<<clotheson>><<endcombat>>
<<link [[Next|Horse Academy]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Ash Time Spend
<<npc Ash>><<person1>>
<<cleareventpool>>
<<if (C.npc.Ash.love gt 80)>>
    <<addinlineevent "ash_love1">>
        “I must apologize for the way I have been treatin' ya lately.” Ash looks geninely apologetic. "I've just been very stressed. Maybe once this whole thing is over, we can start over."
        <br><br>
        <<link [[Next|Horse Academy Entrance]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
    <</addinlineevent>>
	<<addinlineevent "ash_love2">>
        “Even though ya should be trainin', I admit I like spendin' time with ya.” Ash smirks. "Though, ya better still be trainin hard for the races."
        <br><br>
        <<link [[Next|Horse Academy Entrance]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
    <</addinlineevent>>
<<elseif (C.npc.Ash.love gt 40)>>
	<<addinlineevent "ash_midlove1">>
        “Look, I'll spend a little time with ya, but you should be gettin' some more trainin' done for the next race.” Ash shakes <<his>> head with a smirk but lets you sit next to <<him>>.
        <br><br>
        <<link [[Next|Horse Academy Entrance]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
    <</addinlineevent>>
	<<addinlineevent "ash_midlove2">>
        “Still not too sure about ya, sugar.” Ash shakes <<his>> head. "Ya seem nice but... I need ya to put in the work to winnin' this thing."
        <br><br>
        <<link [[Next|Horse Academy Entrance]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
    <</addinlineevent>>
<<else>>
	<<addinlineevent "ash_lowlove1">>
        “Ya wantin' to spend time with me?” Ash looks confused. "I reckon that's okay. Just try not to be so chatty." You spend a while hanging out with Ash.
        <br><br>
        <<link [[Next|Horse Academy Entrance]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
    <</addinlineevent>>
	<<addinlineevent "ash_lowlove2">>
        “Don't you think ya should be gettin' in some more trainin'? Ya got races to win or else.” Ash looks annoyed by your lack of effort.
        <br><br>
        <<link [[Next|Horse Academy Entrance]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
    <</addinlineevent>>
<</if>>
<<runeventpool>>

:: Regional Race Go
<<npc Ash>><<person1>>
You and Ash spend a few hours walking down the road until you arrive at the stadium. A large track surrounded by rows of bleachers sits at the center and fans already fill the seats.
<br><br>
<<if $regionalrace is 6>>
	You hear a small commotion as someone comes barging through.
	<br><br>
    <<link [[Next|Mint Mocha Introduction]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
Ash looks worried about your chances but takes a deep breath and continues. "Well what are ya waitin' for, get in there."
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Regional Race]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Mint Mocha Introduction
<<set $regionalrace to 6>>
<<npc "Mint Mocha">><<person1>>
<<set C.npc["Mint Mocha"].dom to 40>>
The person barging through the croud seems to be a horsegirl with mint green hair lined with brown streaks. She looks at you with crossed arms and scoffs. "Is this the new <<girl>> who thinks <<pshe>> can beat me?" She tosses one of her twintails in confidence. "Try not to get trampled by your betters. See you on the track loser."
<br><br>
Ash smirks at the horsegirl as she walks away and turns back toward you. "Well what are ya waitin' for, lets get ya registered."
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Regional Race Register]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Regional Race Register [exitCheckBypass]
<<npc Ash>><<person1>>
Ash leads you toward the front of the stadium where a young man sits behind a booth taking tickets. Ash takes a moment to speak to the man, before you are led back into the back of the stadium. The man speaks, "Fill out this form and once you're done we can get you placed into the race."
<br><br>
<<textbox "$inputCode" "" autofocus>>
<br>
<<button "Input Racing Name">>
<<set $playerhorsetitle to $inputCode.trim()>>
<<goto "Regional Race">>
<</button>>

:: Regional Race
<<run setup.horserace.ensureState()>><<outfitChecks>>
<<if $horserace.phase is "idle" or $horserace.phase is "finished">>
	<<run setup.horserace.creategirlRace(true)>>
<</if>>
The board changes one last time while the bookie calls for final bets.
<<print setup.horserace.renderHorseList()>>
<<animalicon "horse">><<link [[Begin Race|Regional Race Begin]]>><<set $horserace.betInput to 0>><</link>>

:: Regional Race Begin
<<outfitChecks>>
<<print setup.horserace.renderTrack()>>
<<script>>setTimeout(function () {
	setup.horserace.placeMarkers();
	setup.horserace.refreshLiveView("Racecourse Regional Result", "See the result");
}, 0);<</script>>
<<print setup.horserace.renderRaceLog()>>
<<print setup.horserace.renderLiveControls("Racecourse Regional Result", "See the result", "Start watching", "Pause watching", 1600)>>
<span id="horse-race-result-link">
<<link "Skip to the finish" "Racecourse Regional Result">><<set $horserace.autoWatch to false>><<run setup.horserace.cancelAutoWatch()>><<run setup.horserace.simulateToEnd(false)>><</link>>
</span>

:: Racecourse Regional Result
<<unset $horserace.betFieldId>><<set $horserace.autoWatch to false>><<endevent>>
<<run setup.horserace.cancelAutoWatch()>>
<<if $horserace.phase isnot "finished">>
	<<run setup.horserace.simulateToEnd(false)>>
<</if>>
<<print setup.horserace.renderResult()>>
<br>
<<link [[Next|Post Race Mocha]]>><<set V.regionalrace -= 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Post Race Mocha
<<npc "Mint Mocha">><<person1>>
<<if $raceresult is "win">>
	As you take a deep breath, soaking in your victory, you once again hear the sound of loud footsteps pounding toward you. It's the same horsegirl from before. She frowns, putting her hands to her hips in anger. "How dare you, you... you... rookie loser! How dare you come in here and make me look bad!"
	<br><br>
	She is visibly fuming with anger. "I can hardly stand looking at you! I'm going to train hard and beat you next time, you got that!" She pouts tossing her twintails over her shoulder with frustration before walking away.
	<br><br>
	The crowd parts as you watch the green-haired horsegirl storm off. Without warning, Ash taps your shoulder from behind, catching you by surprise.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Post Race Ash]]>><<endevent>><<set C.npc["Mint Mocha"].dom -= 5>><<set C.npc["Mint Mocha"].love += 10>><</link>>
<<else>>
	You breath heavily. How could you have lost... The crowd parts as someone barges through. It's the same horsegirl from before. She scoffs, putting her hands to her hips with a cocky and confident smile. "Well, how about that. Looks like you really are the loser I thought you were."
	<br><br>
	She lets out a cocky laugh, covering her mouth with her hand. "To think I was actually worried! You're so pathetic." She continues to laugh and lets out a snort as she walks away.
	<br><br>
	As you watch the greenhaired horsegirl leave, you catch sight of Ash watching you with an upset look.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Post Race Ash]]>><<endevent>><<set C.npc["Mint Mocha"].dom += 5>><<set C.npc["Mint Mocha"].love += 3>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Horse Academy Mintro
<<npc "Mint Mocha">><<person1>>
As you approach, the horsegirl looks to you with the look one would give an ugly insect. "Oh it's you again. Ignore <<pher>> girls, she's just a little annoyance."
<br><br>
The girls laugh but you don't leave. "What's wrong with you? Can't you see we have better things to do than spend time with a loser?" 
<br><br>
After a moment of silence, you still do not leave, ruining the girl's mood. One of them, a tall horsegirl with blonde hair looks over and says, "Sorry Mint, this <<girl>> is making us a little uncomfortable." The other girls head inside the academy, leaving just you and the girl they called Mint.
<br><br>
"Ugh you ruined everything. Can't you just leave me alone?" 
<br><br>
You ignore her and introduce yourself and she turns to face you annoyed. "Did you not hear me? I didn't realize you were deaf as well as stupid. Whatever." She huffs. "My name's Mint Mocha. Remember that when I beat you next race."
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Horse Academy Entrance]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Horse Academy Mint Talk
<<npc "Mint Mocha">><<person1>>
